I love you, I want to hold you, but I can't do it...!

165
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:52,100
どう足掻いたってどう願ったって爪も牙も消えない
No matter how much I struggle or wish, my claws and fangs won't disappear

166
00:28:52,380 --> 00:28:57,160
だから、ただ待ってるよ君の涙が止むまで、あの木の先で
So I'll just wait here beyond that tree until your tears stop

167
00:29:20,087 --> 00:29:28,287
あ、聞いた？もしこれを食べたら、君はすぐに回復できる！
Ah, listen! If you eat this, you can recover instantly!

168
00:29:30,327 --> 00:29:32,607
美味しいんだ？
Is it delicious?

169
00:29:35,987 --> 00:29:37,887
