I will guide you to the monster right away.

171
00:29:44,507 --> 00:29:46,407
オッケー、行こう！
Okay, let's go!

172
00:30:00,700 --> 00:30:06,700
飛べ fly, high 汗と血と涙で
Fly high, FLY HIGH!! With sweat, blood, and tears...

173
00:30:07,088 --> 00:30:11,698
光る翼で今全部全部置き去って飛べ fly, high
