高く high
Fly high!

175
00:30:18,868 --> 00:30:21,678
最果ての未来へ
To the furthest future...

176
00:30:22,818 --> 00:30:26,618
傷だらけの若鳥が空を睨んでる
A scar-covered fledgling glares up at the sky.

177
00:30:27,208 --> 00:30:31,168
低空飛行する奴等が
Low-flying ones...

178
00:30:32,608 --> 00:30:36,108
