185
00:31:12,188 --> 00:31:16,808
艱難な旅路も夢叶うまで何度だって飛べ fly
through arduous journeys, fly again and again until dreams come true!

186
00:31:20,658 --> 00:31:24,528
高く fly 最果ての未来へ
Fly high! To the furthest future...

187
