239
00:38:49,767 --> 00:38:55,147
Yang bermakna...
That has meaning...

240
00:39:18,567 --> 00:39:24,147
Stop right there! I'm here to stop you and release all the nyut-nyuts from misery!

241
00:40:32,223 --> 00:40:38,123
ひらひら 葉落月
