252
00:41:32,343 --> 00:41:37,063
うんざりだよ Syndrome:アイシテル あぁ もう やめてよ
I'm so sick of it. Syndrome: "I love you". Ah, just stop it already.

253
00:41:40,013 --> 00:41:46,633
心ってモノを量って切って 売れば幸せですか？
If we weigh and cut up things like hearts and sell them, will we be happy?

254
